      "expr": "02-blush",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cg",
      "action": "hide"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "傍晚。又是 coffee corner。這頓是凌晨約內蒙團團友晚飯聚的。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "baofang",
      "text": "啐，凌晨，慴慴，過一會兒你們中天是不是搞甚麼的，慴慴，天文工作坊？",
      "expr": "02-sweat"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "baofang"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "對啊，本季最後一次。莊員親自指導觀星，絕不容錯過。",
      "expr": "04-cold"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "你不是說天文工作坊都是在 MMW 的講室裡舉行的嗎？在室內怎麼指導觀星？",
      "expr": "01-laugh"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "總之，我們保證即使在室內，依然可以給各位有如親臨星空下的享受。",
      "expr": "05-fire"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "qishan",
      "text": "就老愛替自己搞的活動賣廣告。",
      "expr": "01-grin"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "qishan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "晚飯後就一起來吧。這個月天氣不穩，很久沒星星看了。今夜天朗氣清，工作坊完了或者還可以到 MMW 天台。",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "他身後是一大片烏雲。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "不好意思哩，我過一會兒還得開中文系系莊的會。能上來吃頓晚飯已經很給面子了。",
      "expr": "02-hips"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "qishan",
      "text": "我也不來了。去了也只是聽你胡說八道，省得沾污我的耳朵。",
      "expr": "04-loud"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "qishan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "baofang",
      "text": "不用慌，凌晨，他們不理睬你，還有我這個老友捧你的場。",
      "expr": "03-sauce"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "baofang"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "寶方兄！我太感動了！",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "他看見寶方滿嘴肉醬，沒有抱下去。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "jump",
      "to": "ch08-phone"
    }
  ]
}
